{"id":"65efd3cc5a126de3","group":"58","path":"58/batch15/58-thm-shelah-diamond.md","title":"Shelah Diamond","display":"thm-shelah-diamond — Shelah Diamond","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-shelah-diamond","aliases":["58-thm-shelah-diamond"],"display":"thm-shelah-diamond — Shelah Diamond","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-shelah-diamond"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-shelah-diamond</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-shelah-diamond — Shelah Diamond"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> is a set-coded function on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha\">\\(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Stationary}\">\\(\\mathrm{Stationary}\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> are the exact symbols used by <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d60e0a36bd259287\" href=\"?note=d60e0a36bd259287\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md\">../batch20/58-df-diamond.md</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}diamond}\\vdash\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:S(\\alpha)=X\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}diamond}\\vdash\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}\n&amp;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:S(\\alpha)=X\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the registered characterization of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\">\\(\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\)</span> with the upstream function, regular-cardinal, and two-argument stationarity predicates called exactly.</li>\n<li>The guessing condition must hold on a stationary set of stages for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\kappa\">\\(X\\subseteq\\kappa\\)</span>; one correctly guessed stage is insufficient.</li>\n<li>Shelah's <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\diamondsuit^+\">\\(\\diamondsuit^+\\)</span> is a separate strengthening and is not asserted by this equivalence.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-diamond.md","status":"resolved","id":"d60e0a36bd259287","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\diamondsuit_\\kappa$, $\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S$, $\\mathrm{Stationary}$, and $\\mathrm{Function}$ are the exact symbols used by [[../batch20/58-df-diamond.md]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Stationary}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}shelah\\text{-}diamond}\\vdash\n\\diamondsuit_\\kappa\\leftrightarrow{}\n&\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\omega\\in\\kappa\\land\\\\\n&\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(S,\\kappa,\\mathcal P(\\kappa))\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;(S(\\alpha)\\subseteq\\alpha)\\land\\\\\n&\\qquad\\forall X\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\n\\mathrm{Stationary}(\\{\\alpha\\in\\kappa:S(\\alpha)=X\\cap\\alpha\\},\\kappa)\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit_\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"\\diamondsuit^+","display":false}],"bytes":1425,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-4413","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-thm-shelah-diamond.md|58-thm-shelah-diamond]]（batch15）"}],"outgoing":["d60e0a36bd25928